{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"完备化(环)"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"完备化 (环)"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>环关于理想的完备化给出了"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"闭嵌入","text":"闭子概形"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"形式邻域","text":"形式邻域"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另见"},{"Local":{"url":"完备化(稳定同伦论)","text":"完备化 (稳定同伦论)"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>环 $R$ 关于理想 $I$ 的完备化为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{lim}_nR/I^n.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>整数环 $\\mathbb{Z}$ 关于 $(p)$ 的完备化为 "},{"Local":{"url":"p-进整数","text":"$p$-进整数环"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{Z}_p=\\operatorname{lim}_n \\mathbb{Z}/p^n$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"形式谱","text":"形式谱"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"完备化(域)","text":"完备化 (域)"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}